    </div>
    
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:#000000;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">US Customs Documentation</h3>
        <ul style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            Commercial invoice with HS codes
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            Packing list and bill of lading
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            Certificate of origin
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            Textile fiber content declaration
          </li>
          <li style="padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            Country of origin labeling (COOL)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2.5rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">US-Specific Certifications</h3>
        <ul style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;">
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            C-TPAT (Customs-Trade Partnership Against Terrorism)
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            WRAP (Worldwide Responsible Accredited Production)
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            SA8000 (Social Accountability International)
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            ISO 9001 (Quality Management System)
          </li>
          <li style="padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
            <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
            CPSIA compliance for children's apparel
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- US Duty & Tariff Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Import Costs</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">US Tariffs & Duties</h2>
      <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:600px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;">Understanding US textile tariffs helps you calculate landed costs. Bangladesh benefits from favorable tariff rates compared to many other sourcing countries.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:#000000;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">T-Shirts</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:200;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">16.5%</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.82rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">MFN tariff rate</p>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Cotton and synthetic t-shirts from Bangladesh qualify for standard MFN rates. Some categories may have lower rates under preferential programs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Denim Jeans</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:200;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">16.9%</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.82rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">MFN tariff rate</p>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Men's and women's denim trousers from Bangladesh face standard US tariffs. We provide accurate HTS code classification for your specific products.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Outerwear</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:200;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">15-27%</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.82rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Variable by category</p>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Jackets, coats, and complex garments have varying tariff rates based on material composition and construction. We provide duty estimates with every quote.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- US Sourcing Benefits Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
