    </div>
    
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#000000;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Cost Competitive</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Bangladesh offers 20-30% lower manufacturing costs than domestic US production, while maintaining quality standards required by American consumers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Fast Shipping</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Ocean freight to US West Coast takes 25-30 days, East Coast 30-35 days. Air freight available for urgent orders (5-7 days).</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem">Established Track Record</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Bangladesh has supplied US retailers for {companyAge}, with established logistics and customs procedures for seamless imports.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Compliance Ready</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">C-TPAT certification ensures your shipments clear US customs faster with reduced inspection risk and priority processing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- US FAQ Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
