    </div>
    
    <div style="max-width:800px;">
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is C-TPAT and why is it important for US imports?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">C-TPAT (Customs-Trade Partnership Against Terrorism) is a voluntary supply chain security program. C-TPAT-certified suppliers like SDF Clothing enjoy faster customs clearance, reduced inspections, and priority processing for US-bound shipments.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What documents do I need to import clothing from Bangladesh to the USA?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Required documents include commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading, certificate of origin, textile fiber content declaration, and country of origin labeling. We provide all documentation with every shipment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does shipping from Bangladesh to the USA take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Ocean freight to US West Coast (Los Angeles) takes 25-30 days, to East Coast (New York) takes 30-35 days. Production adds 30-45 days before shipping. Air freight reduces transit to 5-7 days but costs 4-5x more.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What are the US import duties for clothing from Bangladesh?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Duties vary by product category and material. T-shirts typically face 16.5%, denim jeans 16.9%, and outerwear 15-27%. We provide accurate duty calculations and HTS code classification with every quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you handle customs clearance for US shipments?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We provide complete documentation and work with your customs broker to ensure smooth clearance. While you'll need a licensed customs broker for formal entry, our C-TPAT status and proper documentation make the process efficient.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;">
